message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below. Not peer reviewed. Produced by AI models under the direction of the repository owner (see AI_DISCLOSURE.md)."
title: "TESS transit candidates 2026: TIC 402710280, TIC 324429952 and TIC 89247735"
type: dataset
# doi: to be added after the Zenodo deposit (10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX)
authors:
  - family-names: Zarco
    given-names: A.
date-released: "2026-10-18"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alejandrozarco/tess-candidates-2026"
abstract: >-
  Transit timing, light-curve tables, false-positive checks, TRICERATOPS runs and predicted transit times for three
  transit candidates found in TESS full-frame images: TIC 402710280 (P = 36.34005 d, depth about 1680 ppm,
  transit-timing variations up to 29 min), TIC 324429952 (P = 42.37574 d, depth about 1500 ppm) and TIC 89247735
  (P = 18.32317 d, dilution-corrected depth 1.13-1.22 %, Rp about 9.1-9.4 Earth radii). Not peer reviewed; the
  candidates are not confirmed.
keywords:
  - TESS
  - transit candidates
  - exoplanets
  - transit timing variations
  - TIC 402710280
  - TIC 324429952
  - TIC 89247735
